{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791984840, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T13:34:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T13:35:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791984900, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T13:34:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43807, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我土生土長台北人，這是我生活的地方，看樹都被砍光非常痛心，深深希望台北比高雄還美會成真。", "display_name": "松山代表 紜", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T13:34:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49790, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "我覺得士林夜市是專屬台灣，專屬台北市，不能被授權出國，尤其是大陸。山寨要取締跟抗議，而不是授權。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.49,790", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T13:34:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3672, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "Ubike的點越設越多，但ubike也越來越老舊&骯髒⋯在台北市騎ubike也很危險，希望能提升道路", "display_name": "信義代表 No.3,672", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T13:34:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6572, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "教育", "content": "公立國中學校老師的缺額，常常都是不是專業的老師來教導，例如：台語老師去教英文，希望可以有辦法改善", "display_name": "北投代表 No.6,572", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 49790, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.49,790", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 3672, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.3,672", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 6572, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.6,572", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 40543, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "display_name":